{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04S9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}, \\mathcal{Y}, \\mathcal{Z}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-2-category-fibred-setoids}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-category-fibred-setoids-presheaves-products}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9112e8b3b2feeb19509628297e44e8c1f790ae2783c7be7199db0fcd52733327", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:dda4da5d837a4c2da968a3365ddd9f781162ada28a4ce86871b9a26b88981574", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\nThe construction of\nLemma <REF_0001>\nwhich associates to a category fibred in setoids a presheaf is\ncompatible with products, in the sense that the presheaf associated\nto a <MATH_0002>-fibre product <MATH_0003>\nis the fibre product of the presheaves associated to\n<MATH_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ec4ab7da7027661900637b4fa4b18769ce4419bee9cdc3ed17244d20b09da82a", "unit_id": "tag:04SD:statement"}
