 \\Ob(\\mathcal{Z}_U)/\\!\\cong\n$$", "MATH_0001": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Y}_U$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bbf778497ac3349bc6d5cd98792f35e857d9883a2da60453e43f744a072e0d0d", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:3f26bfe8e5d914a53aedaf5c35b6d6c965ed53505d197919113b1b20c1e790fd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1be854bb6d5ef6e51309c2ae2c76f473b0e6cc43c053f68993f088a37a8da3ee", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>. The lemma just says that\n<MATHSEG_0001>equals<MATHSEG_0002>\nthe proof of which we omit. (But note that this would not be true\nin general if the category <MATH_0002> is not a setoid.)\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a6dbc79b33db25bc63a5e76bb3b1389c4abe7b40c3e2706d0232adc2990da59e", "unit_id": "tag:04SD:proof"}
